# Background Task Rules

Use Redis + Celery for background tasks. Use Celery for long-running tasks, batch sync, AI batch analysis, large import/export, external API batch calls.

Task must document purpose, input, output, idempotency, retry policy, side effects, user-visible failure behavior.
